From: PocketForge Worker <worker@pocketforge.invalid>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 18:50:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] hw/arm: classify R-I2C0 aperture precisely

Expose the sun6i register bank as the live model and retain only the register-free tail of the DT reservation as an inert residual stub. Update the machine description and MMIO qtest to keep the distinction explicit.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 docs/pocketforge-a133-peripheral-stubs.md    | 25 +++++++---------
 hw/arm/pocketforge_a133.c                    | 31 ++++++++++----------
 tests/qtest/pocketforge-a133-mmio-map-test.c |  2 ++
 3 files changed, 28 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

